## VM flags for the packaged desktop build (mix release moorland).
## -mode/-name/-sname/-setcookie are configured via env vars, do not set them here.

## Never read standard input: the packaged app must keep running when it is
## started without a console, or when the console's input is closed.
-noinput

## Burrito starts the VM through the Elixir CLI and forwards only the
## binary's own arguments, so nothing says --no-halt and the CLI would halt
## the VM the moment boot finishes. Passing it here keeps the server alive.
## -extra must stay last: everything after it is a plain argument.
-extra --no-halt
